{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>"Hah!
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
　Hyah!
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
　Yah!
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
　Phew..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wow! </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">, you're so cool!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Mm... Do <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> want to try too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hup... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's heavy... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Up we go... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ジャンプ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Hyah!</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Whoa-whoa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Just as I thought, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'re still too young for this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No! I'm gonna be like </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hey, hey, why do </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> hunt with these?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Don't you use guns?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> told me to practice with these."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why?"</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>, every April a scary ghost comes out around here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A ghost?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Yes, a ghost that takes people away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> get taken away by the ghost?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gone from our house because the ghost took her away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... 
{PAUSE ""}
You could... say that, I guess. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, and that's why we have to get stronger than the ghost."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay! I'm gonna get strong like </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">, too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hup... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Whoa... it's still heavy!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But... I'm gonna beat the ghost!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'll get rid of the ghost that took </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> myself!"</STYLE><PG>
{CREATECG "効果音画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "0" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="3">, how's it going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> says she's going to get strong with a nata and a mace too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see, I see. Well, that's a good thing, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, why are we the only ones using a nata and a mace?
{PAUSE ""}
　The other grown-ups hunt with guns."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, that's because you need a license. Guns aren't something just anyone can use."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I see, so that's why."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Besides... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You understand, don't you? Next April, there's no telling who'll be killed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"After all, we don't even know who the culprit is..."</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... So it's to protect ourselves."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, that's part of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But listen, if you find out who the culprit is, you get rid of them right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... By 'get rid of'... 
{PAUSE ""}
you mean kill them?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, you can take it that way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">After all, we're dealing with a devil who kills someone in the settlement every year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And besides..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Besides, they're also the one we need to avenge </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="3">, don't you want to avenge </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Is it really all right? Doing something like that. 
{PAUSE ""}
Wouldn't that get you in trouble, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{DELETECG "効果音画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Look, look!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hyah!</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yaah!"</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're good at that for your first time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehehe! I'm gonna get strong like </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And then I'll beat the ghost that took </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> away and makes trouble for everyone!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'm gonna protect this place!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's my girl, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　That's right, that's how you get strong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
